🟠 api in shop (prod-eu-1) cannot pull its image because secret regcred is not a registry login.
| 🟠 **api** in **shop** (**prod-eu-1**) cannot pull its image because secret **regcred** is not a registry login.
| The registry answers `401 Unauthorized`.
| It fails with
| ```
| Failed to pull image "registry.example.com/shop/api:2.5": failed to pull and unpack image…
| ```
| To list the keys of the Secret the pods depend on, run
| ```
| kubectl describe secret regcred -n shop
| ```
